It just occurred to me that another way one could see the pattern I describe does not require any movement and could occur in uniform habitat: if birds near the observer reduce their song rate, but birds further away do not.

That is not what happened in my case, and is unrelated to my questions.  Nevertheless, it seems to me that this could generate the observed pattern very easily.

Mark

